      "created_at": "2016-12-13T21:46:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ambuscade's incap side say that you remove the Slaughterhouse members from play whenever something would remove them from the play area. &nbsp;Since placing a card on a deck would normally be removing it from the play area, Into the Stratosphere would remove them from play.</p>",
